label Greeting
if {Transaction_Chapter} >= 8.0:
	if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
		ReynaMayari: The pact holds strong, child of the soil. The shadows continue to obey my decree.
		ReynaMayari: I am simply... conducting a routine inspection. [pause=0.5] Make sure everything is in order. Carry on.
	else:
		ReynaMayari: Does the patron of Biringan need a reason to visit her favorite mortal establishment?
		ReynaMayari:  I am merely enjoying the atmosphere. [pause=0.3] And the scent of those little sweet brown cubes you mortals cherish.
else:
	if {Transaction_VisitVar} <= 50:
		ReynaMayari: The stillness of this barangay is a rare occurrence. [pause=0.6] 
		ReynaMayari: I am observing the way you weave the threads of memory within these walls. [pause=0.4] It is... a chaotic tapestry, yet it holds.
	else:
		ReynaMayari: I do not require an installment of your tally today. [pause=0.6] 
		ReynaMayari: I am merely observing the perimeter of my influence and the warmth of this wooden shelter. [pause=0.4] Carry on with your terrestrial obligations, mortal.
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

